Package: METIMMOX1
Type: Project
Title: Secondary Analyses of the METIMMOX Trial
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Ben", "Geisler", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "8674152+ben-geisler@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Code behind three papers on biomarker-guided immunotherapy in
    metastatic microsatellite-stable or mismatch repair-proficient colorectal
    cancer: the clinical effectiveness of candidate biomarkers, a partitioned
    survival cost-effectiveness model of biomarker-guided strategies, and the
    value of further research.
